 "text": "FAQs - CivicPlus.CMS.FAQ\nLoading\nSkip to Main Content\nCreate a Website Account - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\nAbout Brookings County\nYour Government\nOur Departments\nCounty Services\nHow Do I?\nSearch\nAgendas & Minutes\nBid/RFP Postings\nCommunity Voice\nDetention Center\nEmployment\nProperty Records\nPublic Notices\nVoter Information\nHome\nFAQ\nAll categories\nMain\nCommission Department\nEqualization Department\nFinance Department\nRegister of Deeds\nGeographic Information Systems Division\nHuman Resources Division\nState's Attorney\nVeterans' Services Division\n4-H\nGeneral\nFrequently Asked Questions\nGeneral\n4\nAll Content\nWhen are my taxes due?\nTaxes in South Dakota are due and payable the first of January. However, the first half of the property tax payments is accepted until April 30th without penalty. The second half of taxes will be accepted until October 31st without penalty.\nGeneral\nHow do I schedule an item on the commission agenda?\nYou can schedule an item on the County Commission agenda by either contacting the Commission Department Director at 605-696-8205 or by email .\nGeneral\nWho are the Brookings County appointed and elected officials?\nAn list of Brookings County appointed and elected officials and their duties can be viewed at this link:\nBrookings County Officials\nGeneral\nHow can I sign up for notifications from Brookings County?\nAnyone can sign up for text and/or email notifications from Brookings County concerning meeting agendas, road conditions, and weather alerts by signing up in to our Notify Me program at this link:\nNotify Me\nGeneral\nGeneral\n4\nWhen are my taxes due?\nHow do I schedule an item on the commission agenda?\nWho are the Brookings County appointed and elected officials?\nHow can I sign up for notifications from Brookings County?\nAgendas & Minutes\nEmployment\nPay Taxes Online\nVehicle Registration\nVoter Information\nBids/RFP Postings\nContact Us\n520 3rd Street\nBrookings, SD 57006\nDirectory\nQuick Links\nSample Ballot\nSouth Dakota Secretary of State\nApplication for Certified Birth, Marriage, or Death Record\nCertificate of Real Estate\nMarriage License Information & Application\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nFAQs\nWhen are my taxes due?\nHow do I schedule an item on the commission agenda?\nWho are the Brookings County appointed and elected officials?\nHow can I sign up for notifications from Brookings County?\n/FAQ.aspx\nContact Us\nSite Map\nAccessibility\nCopyright Notices\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGovernment Websites by CivicPlus®\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\nBESbswy BESbswy BESbswy BESbswy BESbswy BESbswy BESbswy BESbswy BESbswy BESbswy BESbswy BESbswy\nClose ×",
